r Accounts & Cloud Saving",\n      "description": "User authentication, session-based saving, and document versioning (optional/phase 2).",\n      "isEnabled": false\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Job Description Parser",\n      "description": "Upload or paste job descriptions to auto-highlight and match keywords in the resume (phase 2).",\n      "isEnabled": false\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "LinkedIn Integration",\n      "description": "Pull data from LinkedIn profiles to pre-fill resume sections (phase 2).",\n      "isEnabled": false\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Multilingual Document Generation",\n      "description": "Generate documents in multiple languages (English, French, Spanish, etc.) (phase 2).",\n      "isEnabled": false\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Analytics Dashboard",\n      "description": "Show stats like word count, keyword density, tone score, and readability (phase 2).",\n      "isEnabled": false\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#1a1a2e",\n    "secondary": "#8f60af",\n    "accent": "#be73d3"\n  },\n  "theme": "auto",\n  "layoutDescription": "The UI features a modern, responsive layout with a left-side navigation panel for sections (Personal Info, Education, Experience, etc.), a central form area for data entry, and a right-side real-time preview panel. Users can switch between resume and cover letter previews. Template and export options are accessible via a top bar. The design uses a black-purple color scheme with dynamic, interactive elements and attractive, accessible components."\n}'}",
